Quantum Nematode
================

This product includes rendering formulas adapted from Wormlight
(https://github.com/chrisjz/wormlight), Copyright 2026 Chris Julian Zaharia, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0
(http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0): the worm's tube shading and width profile, the agar,
lawn-rim and meniscus shading, and the playback pacer, as adapted in
packages/quantum-nematode/quantumnematode/env/realistic_renderer.py. The adaptations invert the
brightness for bright-field and replace per-pixel shaders with pre-computed surfaces and offset
polygons.
